<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51208" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĭtŭlīnus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		vitulus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>of a calf.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caruncula,</span>”
				<i>a piece of veal</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Div. 2, 24, 52</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">assum,</span>”
				<i>roast veal</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Fam. 9, 20, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">medulla,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					7, 26, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">5, 24, 3</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					5, 27, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sevum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					5, 19, 9</span></i>
			 and 13.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĭtŭlīna</span></b> ,
			ae, f. (caro), <i>calf's-flesh</i>, <i>veal</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Aul.
				2, 8, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Nep. Ages. 8, 4</span></i> (where vitulina,
				<i>acc. plur.</i> as <i>subst.</i>,
			is the read. of some edd.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
